# --- KubeVirt: CRDs only (no operator, no VMs) ---
# The target has NO KubeVirt Go module in go.mod at v0.1.2: pkg/kubevirt talks to the API through the dynamic client
# with hard-coded GVRs (pkg/kubevirt/gvr.go: kubevirt.io/v1, clone.kubevirt.io/v1beta1, instancetype.kubevirt.io/v1beta1,
# cdi.kubevirt.io/v1beta1, ...). The version that "matches the target" is therefore the one the target's own dev
# tooling installs: build/kubevirt.mk at the pin sets KUBEVIRT_VERSION ?= v1.9.0. v1.9.0 serves every GVR above
# (checked in the v1.9.0 crds.go). Newer at lookup time: v1.9.1 (latest patch), v1.10.0-rc.0 (pre-release); not used.
KUBEVIRT_TAG=v1.9.0
KUBEVIRT_COMMIT=79d34c1762169e5b0370ec491cef5ca12e6b504c
# Release asset (gh release v1.9.0 -R kubevirt/kubevirt; digest as listed by GitHub and checked locally):
